{"id":"n62626-1-7","stage":2,"title":"몇몇 · 几","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62626-1-7-1","ko":"아이들이 언제쯤 다 올까요?","zh":"孩子们大概什么时候都会到呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이들이","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제쯤","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿；쯤：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올까요?","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/218ce831317b168e12a5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62626-1-7-2","ko":"몇몇 아이들은 벌써 와서 기다리고 있어요.","zh":"已经有几个孩子先到了，正在那里等着呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和